m;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.8439em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:3.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"3.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 3240\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M473,2793\nc339.3,-1799.3,509.3,-2700,510,-2702 l0 -0\nc3.3,-7.3,9.3,-11,18,-11 H400000v40H1017.7\ns-90.5,478,-276.2,1466c-185.7,988,-279.5,1483,-281.5,1485c-2,6,-10,9,-24,9\nc-8,0,-12,-0.7,-12,-2c0,-1.3,-5.3,-32,-16,-92c-50.7,-293.3,-119.7,-693.3,-207,-1200\nc0,-1.3,-5.3,8.7,-16,30c-10.7,21.3,-21.3,42.7,-32,64s-16,33,-16,33s-26,-26,-26,-26\ns76,-153,76,-153s77,-151,77,-151c0.7,0.7,35.7,202,105,604c67.3,400.7,102,602.7,104,\n606zM1001 80h400000v40H1017.7z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1561em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>E</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为爱因斯坦角半径，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span> 为相对自行，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>L</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>S</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为透镜与源的距离。微透镜的独特之处在于：它对行星的探测灵敏度峰值落在雪线（snow line）之外的冷区，恰好补上 RV 与凌星偏爱的近轨道之外的盲区；且它不依赖行星发光或宿主恒星明亮，能探测银河系深处、自由漂浮的行星。代价是事件一次性、不可重复，宿主恒星往往太暗难以跟进。罗曼望远镜的银河系核球微透镜巡天预计将把已知冷行星与自由漂浮行星样本大幅扩充，为<a href=\"../formation/planet-diversity\">行星类型与多样性</a>提供 RV 与凌星触及不到的统计。</p>\n<h2 id=\"四种方法的互补版图\">四种方法的互补版图</h2><p>把四种主要方法放在「行星质量 × 轨道距离」的平面上，它们各占一块、彼此互补：<a href=\"radial-velocity\">视向速度法</a>与<a href=\"transit-method\">凌星法</a>主导近轨道、可跟进的行星；直接成像占据宽轨道、年轻自发光的巨行星；微透镜独占雪线外的冷行星与遥远系统。天体测量法（如盖亚）则补上中等轨道距离的大质量行星，它测的是恒星在天球平面上的二维摆动，与 RV 测的视线方向摆动正交，因而能直接定出轨道倾角、破解 RV 的质量简并。没有任何单一方法能给出无偏的行星普查，正确的行星人口统计必须把各方法的探测偏倚（detection bias）逐一建模后再合并——这是理解<a href=\"../characterization/system-architecture\">行星系统结构</a>中行星出现率（occurrence rate）的前提。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>直接成像试图直接捕捉行星自身的光子，核心挑战是对比度与角分辨率，依赖日冕仪、极端自适应光学与干涉测量。</li>\n<li>罗曼望远镜（2026 年底发射）的日冕仪将首次在轨演示优于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{-8}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">8</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的高对比成像，GRAVITY+ 则用干涉把成像样本扩大约一个量级。</li>\n<li>微引力透镜利用广义相对论的引力放大效应探测行星，独占雪线外的冷行星与自由漂浮行星，但事件一次性不可重复。</li>\n<li>直接成像偏好近邻、宽轨道、年轻巨行星；微透镜偏好银河系尺度的冷行星，二者补上了 RV 与凌星的盲区。</li>\n<li>四种方法各有探测偏倚，无偏的<a href=\"../characterization/system-architecture\">行星出现率统计</a>必须综合校正后才能得到。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"直接成像与微引力透镜","id":"直接成像与微引力透镜"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"对比度问题：把行星从眩光里抠出来","id":"对比度问题-把行星从眩光里抠出来"},{"level":2,"text":"干涉测量：用基线换分辨率","id":"干涉测量-用基线换分辨率"},{"level":2,"text":"引力透镜：相对论当探测器","id":"引力透镜-相对论当探测器"},{"level":2,"text":"四种方法的互补版图","id":"四种方法的互补版图"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"凌星法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/exoplanets/detection/transit-method"},"next":{"title":"质量半径与密度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/exoplanets/characterization/mass-radius-density"}}